# Build outputs and installed dependencies are not source.
#
# `npm install --ignore-scripts` is the supported install command here (see
# frontends/README.md section 3): esbuild's postinstall is skipped, and the
# platform package ships the binary, so the build still works. Either way,
# node_modules/ must never be committed.
node_modules/
dist/
.vite/

# The mini-program project has no bundler output of its own; the WeChat DevTools
# compile it. Anything it drops should not be committed either.
miniprogram/**/*.map

# 反向验证的「被改写文件」残骸日志（第 90 条）。
# 它是**运行期状态**，不是源码：正常收尾时脚本自己会删掉它；
# 只有上一次运行被强杀时才会残留 —— 那正是下一轮启动时要读的东西。
tools/_reverse_journal.json
